        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Wed Jan 26 2022 20:06:11 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>For the sixth year in a row, we earned a 100 percent rating on the&nbsp;Human Rights Campaign (HRC) Foundation’s Corporate Equality Index (CEI) for LGBTQ+ Workplace Equality. This is the United States’ foremost benchmarking survey and report measuring corporate policies and practices related to LGBTQ+ workplace equality.<br>\n<br>\nThe HRC gathers information from an annual CEI survey and assigns a rating. Criteria includes equal employment opportunity policies, equitable benefits for LGBTQ+ workers and their families, supporting an inclusive culture and corporate social responsibility.<br>\n<br>\nTo learn more about the Corporate Equality Index, check out <a href=\"https://www.hrc.org/resources/corporate-equality-index\">Human Rights Campaign’s site</a>.<br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Jan 27 2022 14:13:36 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    }
